<title>USA: Cashtek files Chapter 11 bankruptcy.</title>
<headline>Cashtek files Chapter 11 bankruptcy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cashtek Corp said it filed a Chapter 11 petition in the United States Bankruptcy Court for the Southern District of New York.</p>
<p>The company is engaged in the hardware and software development, system integration and marketing of debit card cashless wagering systems for use in gaming establishments and other industries.</p>
